    "collapsible_content_9XaAAt": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_k7Pwd4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What You’re Really Paying For",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Most Shopify builds just cover the basics. We build stores that perform.<br/><br/>When you invest in a Shopify site with us, you're not just getting a nice-looking homepage. You're getting strategy, performance, and the backend plumbing that helps real stores grow. Everything from load speed to mobile responsiveness to upsell flows is designed to work from day one.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_BTA6g6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's Actually Included (and Why It Matters)",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Set-up Shopify Theme</strong><br/><br/>We don’t reinvent the wheel unless you need us to. A smart theme setup gives you speed, stability, and flexibility. We tailor every element — no messy DIY leftovers, no bloated features you won’t use.</p><p><strong>Homepage Design</strong><br/><br/>Your homepage is your online first impression. We build it to convert. Clean layout, trust elements, mobile-optimised, and conversion-friendly from the jump.</p><p><strong>Collections & Categories</strong><br/><br/>Shoppers should never be confused. That’s why we organise your store with the right taxonomy — so people (and Google) can find what they need fast.</p><p><strong>Product Uploads</strong><br/><br/>Each package includes a different volume, but every product gets the basics right: title, description, price, variants, and SEO-friendly tagging.</p><p><strong>Content Pages</strong><br/><br/>Need an About, Contact, FAQ, and Policies? We’ve got it covered. Clear structure, friendly copy, and consistent design — your site will look unified and trustworthy.</p><p><strong>Payment Setup</strong><br/><br/>From Shopify Payments to PayPal, we handle the setup, test everything, and make sure funds land where they’re supposed to.</p><p><strong>Newsletter & Social Media Links</strong><br/><br/>Your footer and key areas will link out to your socials, and we’ll drop in a newsletter form for future email marketing.</p><p><strong>Blog Setup</strong><br/><br/>Yes, blogs still work for SEO. If you're planning to create content, we'll structure your blog the right way and get you set up to publish.</p><p><strong>Personalised Admin Guide</strong><br/><br/>We don’t leave you stranded. Our guides help you understand the backend so you know how to manage your store day-to-day. No jargon, just plain English.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_FGYXji": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How Our Builds Are Different",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>In-House Only</strong><br/><br/>We don’t outsource. Every build is done by our Canberra-based team. That means better quality control, faster updates, and no middlemen.</p><p><strong>Support After Build</strong><br/><br/>Depending on your package, we offer one-on-one Google Meets or in-person support. We'll walk you through connecting your domain, setting up payments, and understanding your admin.</p><p><strong>No Cookie-Cutter Templates</strong><br/><br/>Even if we start with a theme, the result is custom. Fonts, colour palettes, layout, copy — all tailored to your brand. You won’t look like the store next door.</p><p><strong>SEO Basics Included</strong><br/><br/>We structure your content to rank: clean URLs, meta titles and descriptions, alt tags, and fast load speeds. SEO foundations are baked in.</p><p><strong>Mobile-First Design</strong><br/><br/>70%+ of shoppers are on mobile. Your site has to look sharp and work fast on any device. We optimise everything to look and sell well on the small screen.</p><p><strong>Future-Proofed</strong><br/><br/>As your store grows, your setup shouldn’t hold you back. Our builds are scalable, upgrade-ready, and built with clean architecture so you can add apps, expand, or customise further down the track.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_RDPfiN": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why This Isn’t “Cheap” – And Shouldn’t Be",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Anyone can build a Shopify site. Not everyone builds one that converts, scales, and gets results. When you work with us, you’re paying for experience, conversion know-how, and a process that works.</p><p>A $3,500 build with us will often outperform a $10,000 overseas site that looks pretty but fails to bring in sales. Why? Because we <strong>know</strong> what works — and we don’t cut corners.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "collapsible_row_k7Pwd4",
        "collapsible_row_BTA6g6",
