    "marketing_focus_3m6ihY": {
      "type": "marketing-focus",
      "name": "Shopify Marketing Focus Section",
      "settings": {
        "key": "1",
        "logo_image": "shopify://shop_images/04.jpg",
        "headline": "Want to Know What’s Right For You?",
        "sub_text": "We’ll walk you through the packages, answer your questions, and map out exactly what your store needs to launch or grow.",
        "button_text": "Speak To Our Shopify Experts",
        "button_link": "shopify://pages/contact",
        "desktop_padding_top": 30,
        "desktop_padding_bottom": 30,
        "mobile_padding_top": 20,
        "mobile_padding_bottom": 20
      }
    },
    "collapsible_content_HTJpwf": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_MBjwbm": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why Pages Matter",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Most tradies and service providers don’t need a 30-page site—but you do need the right 6–12 pages. That includes a solid homepage, service pages tailored for SEO, an About page that builds trust, and a contact or quote form that actually works. We build around what your business <em>actually does</em>—not a cookie-cutter template</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_iP9zjK": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Integrations That Make Life Easier",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We integrate booking calendars, contact forms, payment gateways, and even photo upload options so leads come in ready to go. No more back-and-forth to get job details—you’ll get everything at once.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_nnkcgV": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Built to Convert, Not Just Sit Pretty",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>A good website isn’t just about design—it’s about function. Ours are built to work hard for you: clean calls-to-action, lead capture, mobile responsiveness, and fast page load speeds. We write clear content that speaks your customer’s language.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_AXchGJ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Mobile First, Always",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Over 70% of service website traffic comes from phones. We design mobile-first so your site works perfectly on every device—and we test it like your customer would.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_6aCGxm": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Security & Peace of Mind",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Your website is secured with SSL, runs on fast hosting, and is protected with form spam filters and best practices. We build every project to last—and give you a handover session so you know exactly how to use it.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_f8mXdk": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Real Support, No Outsourcing",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Every site is built by our in-house Aussie team. After launch, we’ll guide you through everything—connecting your domain, setting up your email, or learning the CMS. You get real support, not a bot.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
