    "collapsible_content_AaqC7V": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_cmnmxH": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What’s the difference between the Launch, Growth, and Enterprise Paid Ads Packages?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<ul><li><strong>Launch</strong> is perfect if you’re running a small, single-platform ad campaign — like Google Search or Facebook Lead Ads — and just need to get profitable fast.</li><li><strong>Growth</strong> is for businesses ready to be seen across <strong>multiple platforms at once</strong>, like Google + Facebook or Facebook + TikTok, with real strategy between them.</li><li><strong>Enterprise</strong> is for brands ready to <strong>dominate</strong> their market with multi-channel ad campaigns, funnel building, high-volume budgets, and constant optimisations across Google, Facebook, TikTok, YouTube, and even LinkedIn if needed.</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_jPFM4h": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do I have to sign a long contract?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>No.<br/><br/>All our Paid Ads packages now only require a <strong>3-month minimum</strong>.<br/><br/>We do this because serious results need at least 90 days to gather real data, optimise properly, and start scaling.<br/><br/>After that? It's month-to-month — you stay because you’re happy, not because you’re locked in.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_GezWQt": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What happens during onboarding?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<ul><li>We kick off with a strategy session to understand your business, goals, and target audience.</li><li>We build your campaigns from scratch or overhaul what you already have.</li><li>We set up full tracking (Google Analytics, Pixels, Conversion Events) to make sure every dollar spent is tracked properly.</li><li>You’ll get a clear roadmap of what we’re doing and when — no guessing.</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_d4QKEi": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What’s included in the setup fee?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The one-time setup fee covers the heavy lifting at the start:</p><ul><li>Full strategy mapping</li><li>Campaign architecture</li><li>Target audience research</li><li>Copywriting for ad creatives</li><li>Designing image or video ads if needed</li><li>Pixel & conversion tracking setups</li><li>Launching your first ads</li></ul><p>Once that’s done, your monthly fee covers <strong>optimisation and scaling</strong>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_CEw3Rk": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How much should I spend on ads?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Here’s the honest answer:<br/><br/>Your monthly ad spend should match your revenue goals.</p><p>As a very loose guide:</p><ul><li>Small local service businesses often start at <strong>$1,000–$2,000/month</strong> in ad spend.</li><li>Growing eCommerce stores typically invest <strong>$3,000–$10,000/month</strong> across Google and Meta.</li><li>Serious scaling brands sometimes spend <strong>$15,000+ monthly</strong>.</li></ul><p>We’ll help you figure out the best starting budget based on your goals.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Yy3fiN": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will you create the ads too?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes — if you’re on Growth or Enterprise, <strong>ad creative support is included</strong> every month.<br/><br/>We can design:</p><ul><li>Static image ads</li><li>Carousel ads</li><li>Video edits (basic social-style videos)</li><li>Responsive search ads</li></ul><p>If you’re on Launch, we help create simple ads too — and we’ll guide you if you want to supply your own creatives.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_BRx94N": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do you track results?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<ul><li>Google Analytics</li><li>Facebook/TikTok Pixels</li><li>Conversion Events</li><li>Google Tag Manager</li><li>Looker Studio (Google Data Studio) dashboards</li></ul><p>We’ll set up everything needed to track leads, sales, and ROI — not just impressions and clicks.</p><p>You’ll know exactly <strong>what’s working</strong> and <strong>what’s not</strong>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_yLcw3q": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What’s the reporting like?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>You get a clean, human-readable report every month — no confusing spreadsheets.</p><ul><li>We tell you how many leads, sales, or actions you got.</li><li>We explain what we optimised and why.</li><li>You’ll know where your money went — and how we’re making it stretch further.</li></ul><p>If you’re on Enterprise, you also get a live dashboard you can check any time.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_gNVJEi": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I change plans later?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Of course.<br/><br/>If you start with Launch and want to scale bigger after 3 months, you can upgrade to Growth or Enterprise.<br/><br/>If you slow down? You can scale back too.<br/><br/>We flex with your business, not the other way around.</p><h3></h3>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_dmm73M": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why trust An Agency with my paid ads?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<ul><li>We don’t outsource — your ads are managed <strong>in-house</strong> by real Aussie marketers.</li><li>We know how to drive traffic <strong>and</strong> how to make sure that traffic <strong>converts</strong>.</li><li>No fluff, no bloated costs, no locked-in, painful contracts.</li><li>We run ads for ourselves too — so we treat your money like it's our own.</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
