    "collapsible_content_D44Qaj": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_iCWAfT": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does a branding project usually take?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Branding timelines vary by package, but typically:</p><ul><li>Launch Package: 2-3 weeks</li><li>Growth Package: 4-5 weeks</li><li>Enterprise Package: 6-8 weeks<br/></li></ul><p>We move fast but make sure there's enough time for proper creative rounds.<br/><br/><em>Need it faster? Talk to us about priority scheduling.</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_patkYK": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will I own my logo and brand files?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, 100%. You receive full ownership of all brand assets we create for you, including final logo files and any collateral designed. No hidden fees or licensing issues down the track.<br/><br/><em>We’ll even organise all your files neatly for easy handover.</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_KzfJix": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What happens if I want extra collateral after launch?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>No problem! We can design additional pieces like signage, brochures, or even full social media kits. You'll have access to discounted add-on pricing as a branding client.<br/><br/><em>Ask us for a custom bundle if you’re planning future marketing materials.</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_3kqxf4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do I need to have a business name or idea before branding?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Ideally yes – branding comes <em>after</em> you've locked down your name. If you still need help naming your business, we can recommend a separate name development service.<br/><br/><em>Already got your name? Perfect. Let's build your identity around it.</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_JeVcxj": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I upgrade my branding package later?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Absolutely. If you start with the Launch package and later want to expand into Growth or Enterprise, we’ll credit part of your original payment toward the upgrade.<br/><br/><em>Talk to us anytime if you’re ready to level up.</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_xrHqpL": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What if I’m not 100% happy with the logo concepts?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We include revision rounds for each package to make sure you’re thrilled. And for Enterprise branding clients, we guarantee satisfaction with flexible extra revisions if needed.<br/><br/><em>We don’t stop tweaking until you’re proud to show it off.</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Xmq6Jn": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will you help guide how to use the brand in real-world marketing?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Our Brand Guides show you how to apply your branding across social media, websites, and marketing materials. For Enterprise clients, we also run live team training sessions to get everyone aligned.<br/><br/><em>We'll set you up with everything you need to roll it out like a pro.</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_HN3fq3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is this just for online branding or for print materials too?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Both. Every logo and asset we deliver is suitable for both print (like signage and business cards) and digital (like your website, socials, and email marketing).<br/><br/><em>Your brand will look sharp everywhere you show up.</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_jXbM6H": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How much input do I have in the process?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Plenty. We’ll work closely with you at the start to understand your vision. You’ll then review concepts, give feedback, and shape the final outcome together with our designers.<br/><br/><em>It’s a collaborative process, not a hand-off.</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_8y94Ea": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What if I already have a logo but need a full brand refresh?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We can work with your existing logo if it’s strong – or recommend a refresh if needed. A Growth or Enterprise package is perfect for businesses ready to upgrade their whole identity while keeping some brand equity intact.<br/><br/><em>Let’s audit your current branding and build a plan together.</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
